{"_id":"0c7cadd8-3101-465f-a93d-f4d58047daab","author":null,"body":[{"_key":"2a8e58f98bbd","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"44f61cfed30b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"So, you’ve got expense reports to process? \nYou think: \"I'll just simply enter the records manually.\"\n\nA few more numbers pile up? \nNo problem. \n\"How about just pulling out that popular third‑party tool?\"\nYou wonder.\n\nProblem solved? Eh, maybe not exactly....\n"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"03249249955f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"e6bf262a04ea","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"According to LinkedIn, "},{"_key":"29c298be675c","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"over 80% of businesses still rely on manual processes in 2025"},{"_key":"8d2c77d3d82e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":". Such inefficient processes and disconnected tools eat up "},{"_key":"8bceb89f7530","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"about 30% of an employee’s workweek"},{"_key":"32726e153355","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", says a McKinsey report, quietly draining time, focus, and profitability across organisations. That’s not good ROI."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"5a27168bd86c","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"98642a4f6fa5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What’s good ROI? It’s more often than not that “boring” but functional custom app (customer‑facing or internal) that automates the grind, centralizes workflows, and quietly compounds value."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"5ee7a9e387f2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b2c61489f4c2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"So, what if the “boring” app idea you’ve been mulling over, but haven’t quite started on, is the one quietly holding back your business growth? Here’s the breakdown and the bigger picture behind it"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ef2e6049047c","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"25818cfe0ab2","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Why Organizations Undervalue Custom Apps"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"b0d2f13d1fa4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"9311be02bfe0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Comfort feels safe. Manual work and off‑the‑shelf tools look familiar, so business owners and managers stick with them. They’re quick to adopt, easy to explain, and don’t demand much upfront investment."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"6951fda332b4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"796c6a02b2d6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"But that comfort creates blind spots. Any suggestions for internal apps at board meetings are dismissed as “optional” or secondary."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"9758c8acd7ef","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"281d1aeac45e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The misconception runs deeper still. Many still confuse functional apps with static websites, or “just something nice to have.”"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"aedd6266a04f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"4231c60daa4d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The reality in the wild, however, is that, as the "},{"_key":"adce697e1d75","_type":"span","marks":["79d02e168a01"],"text":"Harvard Business Review"},{"_key":"10e6e57ca7f4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" shows, companies that invest in custom digital tools consistently outperform peers who rely only on generic platforms."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"79d02e168a01","_type":"link","href":"https://hbr.org/2023/11/why-companies-should-invest-in-digital-tools"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c596f5001412","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"7411a1696ad3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Bottom line: What looks “boring” on the surface often becomes the backbone of efficiency, profitability, and growth."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"10987c2bf678","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"45b3eeda5a7d","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"The Hidden Cost of Conventional Approaches"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"29e864fe2091","_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-943c651da5f804dab48b348812519687dc106bd9-8500x5046-jpg","_type":"reference"}},{"_key":"cbda7b7f752e","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"0d32ca5ca367","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The trouble with “conventional” tools isn’t loud or obvious. It creeps in quietly through wasted hours, scattered data, and hidden costs that compound over time."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"2875306dfc17","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"414f3af86714","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Operational Inefficiencies"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h4"},{"_key":"56da89f94ce0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"f573468c82dd","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Manual processes look manageable until they pile up. Approvals stuck in inboxes, errors buried in spreadsheets, and repetitive tasks eat away at focus. According to "},{"_key":"ebd5673b6acf","_type":"span","marks":["ba9295b564c2"],"text":"McKinsey"},{"_key":"f78680b84709","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", inefficient workflows can consume nearly a third of an employee’s workweek. That’s time lost to routine admin instead of strategy, innovation, or customer service."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"ba9295b564c2","_type":"link","href":"https://www.mckinsey.com/capabilities/operations/our-insights/the-productivity-imperative"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"27b3c5dc80eb","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"dcb9772b1f7b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Financial Leakages"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h4"},{"_key":"f60aa3c488fc","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"028c4aaef450","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Then there’s the money drain. Subscriptions stack up for overlapping tools, each looking cheap on its own but quietly eroding margins together. Data scattered across platforms makes reporting harder and accountability weaker. A "},{"_key":"87f0c0d464f2","_type":"span","marks":["fc628110d805"],"text":"Gartner"},{"_key":"02e72022549d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" study estimates billions wasted annually on duplicate SaaS subscriptions."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"fc628110d805","_type":"link","href":"https://www.gartner.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/2024-05-15-gartner-says-organizations-waste-billions-on-saas-duplication"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"1b46f6d13742","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"8053f28b6b36","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Takeaway? Conventional approaches don’t just slow you down; they bleed both time and money."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"4bfbb604474b","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"8973cb998a2e","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Built for Function: The ROI of “Boring”"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"3d59c6439cc4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"535dcd0ddb0e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The apps that quietly transform ROI aren’t built to impress; they’re built to work. They automate and centralize workflows that drain time and money, improve compliance and reporting, and reduce human error. They speed up execution, support scalability, and deliver reliability day after day."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"719a28723815","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"9bb7a6a23791","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Think of an HR manager juggling onboarding with spreadsheets and email chains. A simple internal app that automates approvals, centralizes employee records, and flags compliance issues doesn’t look glamorous. But it saves hours each week, reduces mistakes, and keeps processes consistent."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"01c07d4d0fb2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"e11c4d7834f2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"These apps are quality‑tested, stable, and designed for daily use. Not flashy. Not viral. Just functional. And that’s where the real ROI lives."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"2c26e3016d90","_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-9914f357412747deea4826791ac36c2d734704e8-6000x4500-jpg","_type":"reference"},"crop":{"_type":"sanity.imageCrop","bottom":0.06448454924661616,"left":0.08882587390060667,"right":0.13591236590542063,"top":0.18068451320017878},"hotspot":{"_type":"sanity.imageHotspot","height":0.7548309375532051,"width":0.7752617601939726,"x":0.476456753997593,"y":0.5580999819767813}},{"_key":"db71175277ec","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"580ed71eccd1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Closing Insight"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"d7c07a319ebf","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"1a5a72ecf869","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The real shift is in the mindset, not just tools. From "},{"_key":"c0407db30630","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"“Do we really need this?”"},{"_key":"604a3a537f0c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" to "},{"_key":"174aa2a6d601","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"“How did we ever operate without it?”"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"5c93db7dda31","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"f46773b0fdcd","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The best digital investments are often invisible to customers. They don’t trend. They don’t sparkle. But they quietly transform how the business runs."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"a4e4c54177a3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"291eac94c2d1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What feels boring on the surface often becomes your most competitive edge. Reliable. Functional. Resilient. And the kind of ROI that compounds over time.Looking to turn that “boring” idea into a functional app that actually drives ROI? "},{"_key":"5d0eaa82f373","_type":"span","marks":["b4991c792858"],"text":"Tekfolio’s mobile app solutions"},{"_key":"22b16269dcec","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" are built for reliability, scalability, and everyday use."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"b4991c792858","_type":"link","href":"https://tekfolio.ng/mobile-apps"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c52757a7d088","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"76617a1d6894","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"categories":[{"_id":"02d22fef-11f5-4f46-8884-bee3a108ea97","slug":null,"title":"mobile applications"},{"_id":"836cf909-e0a3-49d9-944b-1b7cd43529dd","slug":null,"title":"custom apps"},{"_id":"2a9fda4c-c655-4bed-9e6e-e9201e245fa9","slug":null,"title":"cross-platform apps"}],"excerpt":"What if that app idea you’ve been mulling over, but haven’t quite started on, is the one quietly holding back your business growth? \n","mainImage":{"alt":"Companies that invest in custom digital tools consistently outperform peers ","asset":{"_ref":"image-7492da827e51f2bfa769004e5dc8204c9df9717d-5000x3333-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"publishedAt":"2025-12-27T21:41:00.000Z","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"the-boring-app-that-transforms-roi"},"title":"The “Boring” App That Transforms ROI"}